OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do North East businesses need
OL,4,Afrom the Budget?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA leading economist has called on
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey to do more to
OL,8,Fhelp local businesses in the upcoming
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FSunderland-born Andy Haldane, former
OL,12,Fchief economist at the Bank of England,
OL,13,Fsaid north-east England firms had faced
OL,14,Fa "huge squeeze over the last 10
OL,15,Fyears".
OL,17,FHaldane, now president of the British
OL,18,FChambers of Commerce, called on the
OL,19,Fgovernment to lower costs for
OL,20,Fbusinesses and devolve power and
OL,21,Ffunding to the local level.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
