OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do North East businesses need
OL,4,Afrom the Budget?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Treasury said
OL,7,Fthe chancellor was "fully focused" on
OL,8,Fgiving "businesses a bit of breathing
OL,9,Fspace". Healey will set out Labour's
OL,10,Ftax and spending plans when he delivers
OL,11,Fhis first Budget on 28 October.
